| gate | measured result |
|---|---|
| G1 | 15/15 plants verified (3 presets × 5 seeds) |
| G2 | 5/5 corruptions rejected with 5 distinct reasons |
| G3 | 2/2 model-style variants parsed, including untagged fenced JSON |
