Implemented and locally verified a native Track B generator based on the paper’s \( \mathbb Z_{125} \) difference families ([full paper](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2504.18390)).

Key results:

- All nine local gates pass.
- G4: 0/200,000 random successes.
- Exact shipping density: 1 valid answer in 11,019,960,576.
- Four heuristic attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference Algorithm X: 4,754 operations; compact invariant route: at most 98.
- Explicit development independently confirmed 525 blocks and exact coverage of all 7,875 point-pairs.
- A 200-seed stress test found no recovery or uniqueness failures.

